      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00018",
      "en_US": "I’m on patrol for suspicious individuals."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00019",
      "en_US": "Irene: Who are you?!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00020",
      "garbage": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00021",
      "en_US": "Irene: I’ll tell my sister about you!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00022",
      "en_US": "Irene: I’ll tell my sister about you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Irene: How did you find this place?\f",
        "This is our hideout!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Jenn: What the...?\n",
        "What are you doing?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00025",
      "garbage": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Jenn: Better not laugh yet.\n",
        "My sister is really strong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Jenn: You and us... We might as well\n",
        "become friends!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Kate: I must pay you back for taking\n",
        "care of my sisters!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00029",
      "garbage": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Kate: You are so strong.\n",
        "We lost with no excuses...\r",
        "Here, take this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00031",
      "garbage": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Kate: I’m sorry we jumped you.\r",
        "We never expected anyone to find \n",
        "us here.\f",
        "You sure startled us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 34\n",
        "South to Azalea Town"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "North to Goldenrod City\n",
        "The Radio Tower at Goldenrod is giving\f",
        "away Radio Cards.\r",
        "Answer their questions and receive a\n",
        "Radio Card!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Day Care\n",
        "Let us raise your Pokémon for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00036",
      "en_US": "Lyra: Grandpa!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: Good work, Grandpa!\n",
        "The Pokémon you raised for me has\f",
        "been as healthy as can be!\r",
        "You look fit, too!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00038",
      "en_US": "Lyra: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00039",
      "en_US": [
        "Let me introduce you.\n",
        "This is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. He’s a Trainer.\r",
        "He seems to be getting better at\n",
        "raising Pokémon.\r",
        "Well, not as good as you, Grandpa,\n",
        "of course!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00040",
      "en_US": "Follow me, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00041",
      "en_US": "Ethan: Grandpa!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00042",
      "en_US": [
        "Ethan: Good work, Grandpa!\n",
        "The Pokémon you raised for me has\f",
        "been as healthy as can be!\r",
        "You look fit, too!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00043",
      "en_US": "Ethan: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "Let me introduce you.\n",
        "This is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. She’s a Trainer.\r",
        "She seems to be getting better at\n",
        "raising Pokémon.\r",
        "Well, not as good as you, Grandpa,\n",
        "of course!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00045",
      "en_US": "Follow me, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0384_R34_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "I have an idea!\n",
        "I’ll give you our numbers.\r",
        "Then you can check on the Pokémon\n",
